      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 2.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 2.98,
      "end_seconds": 6.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.38,
      "end_seconds": 11.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I've been dealing with sore ankles"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.29,
      "end_seconds": 15.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.74,
      "end_seconds": 28.72,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "so, I take sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day i mean, I'd been on escitalopram, not any more though, I stopped"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.56,
      "end_seconds": 46.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.2,
      "end_seconds": 50.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "For about three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.23,
      "end_seconds": 55.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Alright, how often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.54,
      "end_seconds": 75.1,
      "duration_seconds": 18.56,
      "text": "I'd say all the time. Actually, and there's tender red lumps on my shins as well, two months now. Yeah, you know, there was tiredness, yes, but that that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.93,
      "end_seconds": 81.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Have you had sore ankles before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.62,
      "end_seconds": 89.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last winter. It went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.79,
      "end_seconds": 95.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "a few quick ones: weight loss or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 100.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "hmm, no, no weight loss or night sweats"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.28,
      "end_seconds": 108.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "And what about fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.71,
      "end_seconds": 113.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "No, not a a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.96,
      "end_seconds": 115.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.22,
      "end_seconds": 121.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.49,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.27,
      "end_seconds": 150.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.34,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I hardly move around during the day. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.51,
      "end_seconds": 163.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.45,
      "end_seconds": 167.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.35,
      "end_seconds": 173.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "So, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.33,
      "end_seconds": 177.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Depression, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.3,
      "end_seconds": 183.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.08,
      "end_seconds": 188.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.46,
      "end_seconds": 194.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "okay, I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.64,
      "end_seconds": 210.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.92,
      "end_seconds": 236.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 75, pressure 121 over 69, temperature is 36.9 degrees, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.2,
      "end_seconds": 242.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.04,
      "end_seconds": 245.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.18,
      "end_seconds": 248.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.24,
      "end_seconds": 269.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "there are tender raised red nodules on both shins and your ankles are puffy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.41,
      "end_seconds": 285.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Okay, thinking it through, the most likely explanation is possible sarcoidosis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.36,
      "end_seconds": 289.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "So, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.07,
      "end_seconds": 325.96,
      "duration_seconds": 34.89,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like possible sarcoidosis, but I'd like to confirm i'll request blood tests, it'll help with possible sarcoidosis i think a chest X-ray makes sense here, for cough and erythema nodosum rest and elevate the legs, and I'm arranging a chest clinic review we'll refer you to the respiratory clinic keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.37,
      "end_seconds": 330.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the tests."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.01,
      "end_seconds": 336.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.89,
      "end_seconds": 340.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.63,
      "end_seconds": 344.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.61,
      "end_seconds": 346.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
